S\n          synonyms:\n            - yeah\n            - yep\n            - yes yes\n            - okay\n            - sure\n            - yes maam\n            - yes please\n            - yes i would\n            - yes i did\n            - that's correct\n            - that is correct\n            - that's right\n            - that is right\n        - id: NO\n          displayName: NO\n          synonyms:\n            - nope\n            - wrong\n            - no no"}]}
