<tag>V='E'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANf'/><tag>V='F'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANg'/><tag>V='G'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANh'/><tag>V='H'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANi'/><tag>V='I'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANj'/><tag>V='J'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANk'/><tag>V='K'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANl'/><tag>V='L'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANm'/><tag>V='M'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANn'/><tag>V='N'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANp'/><tag>V='P'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANq'/><tag>V='Q'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANr'/><tag>V='R'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANs'/><tag>V='S'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANt'/><tag>V='T'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANu'/><tag>V='U'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANv'/><tag>V='V'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANw'/><tag>V='W'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANx'/><tag>V='X'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANy'/><tag>V='Y'</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml#ANz'/><tag>V='Z'</tag></item></one-of></rule></grammar>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: CustomRegexEntity\nreason: The GRXML grammar defines patterns of letters and digits to match Arizona driving license numbers. It uses combinations of alphabetic and numeric characters of specific lengths and patterns. Such entity can't be represented as a simple closed list, so it should be converted to a regex based Custom Entity.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: Arizona_Driver_License_Number\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: Arizona_Driver_License_Number\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '(^[A-Z][0-9]{5,6}$)|(^[A-Z]{2}[0-9]{5}$)|(^[A-NP-Z]{1}[0-9]{8}$)|(^[0-9]{9}$)'\n      examples:\n        - A123456\n        - AB12345\n        - B98765432\n        - 123456789"}]}
