{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Convert the file DL_FL(1) to Microsoft Copilot Studio Yaml.  File content:      <grammar version='1.0' xml:lang='en-us' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2001/06/grammar' root='_ROOT_'><rule id='_ROOT_' scope='public'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='#license'/><tag>if (SWI_vars.disallow) { var disallow_arr = SWI_vars.disallow.split('^'); disallowList = SWI_vars.disallow; for (var i=0; i &lt; disallow_arr.length; i++) { if (license.SWI_meaning == disallow_arr[i]) { SWI_disallow=1; break; } } } if(license.SWI_meaning) {SWI_meaning=license.SWI_meaning; dm_root=license.SWI_meaning;}; if(license.dm_command) {SWI_meaning=license.dm_command; dm_command=license.dm_command}; if(license.dm_confirmation_mode) {dm_confirmation_mode=license.dm_confirmation_mode}; if(license.dm_confirm_string) {dm_confirm_string=license.dm_confirm_string}; grammar_version='20180502'; MEANING=SWI_meaning; var days_in_month=[31,29,31,30,31,30,31,31,30,31,30,31]; var check_digits=SWI_meaning.substring(9,12); check_digits = parseInt(check_digits, 10); for (i = 0; i &lt; 11; i++){ min = days_in_month[i] + (i)*40; max = ((i+1)*40)+1; if((check_digits &lt; max &amp;&amp; check_digits &gt; min) || (check_digits &lt; max+500 &amp;&amp; check_digits &gt; min+500) || (check_digits === 0) || (check_digits &gt; 971)){ SWI_disallow=1; break; } } ps_gramlib_id='untested_nr10_enus_drivers_license_FL';</tag></item></one-of></rule><rule id='license' scope='public'><ruleref uri='soundexLastName.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + S.V : S.V;</tag><item repeat='0-1'><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#dash'/></item><item repeat='3'><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item repeat='0-1'><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#dash'/></item><item repeat='2'><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item repeat='0-1'><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#dash'/></item><item repeat='3'><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item repeat='0-1'><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#dash'/></item><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag><tag>SWI_meaning = V;</tag></rule></grammar>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: Custom RegexEntity\nreason: The GRXML describes a custom entity with a structured pattern to identify a Florida driver's license number, combining letters and digits with optional dashes, and validating it with internal logic. This complexity and structured pattern clearly indicate it should be implemented as a RegexEntity.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: FloridaDriverLicense\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: FloridaDriverLicense\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '^[A-Za-z]\\d{3}-?\\d{2}-?\\d{3}-?\\d{1}$'\n      validationDescription: 'Florida driver license format: one character followed by three digits, optionally separated by dash, two digits optionally separated by dash, three digits optionally separated by dash, and one final digit. Example: A123-45-678-9 or A123456789.'"}]}
