stomRegexEntity\nreason: The provided GRXML file captures driver's license numbers following specific alphanumeric or numeric patterns (e.g., AAA-99-9999 or 999-99-9999). Since this entity relies on structured patterns with alphanumeric characters, digits, and special characters (\"-\"), it should be classified as a RegexEntity in Copilot Studio.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: DL_ND\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: DL_ND\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '(^[A-Za-z]{3}-?\\d{2}-?\\d{4}$)|(^\\d{3}-?\\d{2}-?\\d{4}$)'"}]}
