{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Convert the file DL_WA(1) to Microsoft Copilot Studio Yaml.  File content:      <grammar version='1.0' xml:lang='en-us' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2001/06/grammar' root='_ROOT_'><rule id='_ROOT_' scope='public'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='#license'/><tag>if (SWI_vars.disallow) { var disallow_arr = SWI_vars.disallow.split('^'); disallowList = SWI_vars.disallow; for (var i=0; i &lt; disallow_arr.length; i++) { if (license.SWI_meaning == disallow_arr[i]) { SWI_disallow=1; break; } } } if(license.SWI_meaning) {SWI_meaning=license.SWI_meaning; dm_root=license.SWI_meaning;}; if(license.dm_command) {SWI_meaning=license.dm_command; dm_command=license.dm_command}; if(license.dm_confirmation_mode) {dm_confirmation_mode=license.dm_confirmation_mode}; if(license.dm_confirm_string) {dm_confirm_string=license.dm_confirm_string}; grammar_version='20180502'; MEANING=SWI_meaning; for (var i=0; i &lt; 4; i++) { if (SWI_meaning.substring(i,i+1) === '*' &amp;&amp; SWI_meaning.substring(i+1,5) !== Array(5-i).join('*')) { SWI_disallow=1; break; } } ps_gramlib_id='untested_nr10_enus_drivers_license_WA'</tag></item></one-of></rule><rule id='license' scope='public'><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag><item repeat='4'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#star'/><tag>V = V ? V + '*' : '*';</tag></item></one-of></item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag><one-of><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#star'/><tag>V = V ? V + '*' : '*';</tag></item></one-of><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag><one-of><item><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item></one-of><one-of><item><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#star'/><tag>V = V ? V + '*' : '*';</tag></item></one-of><item repeat='2'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item></one-of></item><tag>SWI_meaning=V;</tag></rule></grammar>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: CustomRegexEntity\nreason: The provided GRXML is designed for recognition and validation of diverse driver's license number formats for Washington state. It involves a combination of repeated alpha, numeric, and special characters (stars), clearly indicating a complex pattern recognition scenario best suited to regular expression validation.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: DL_WA\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: DL_WA\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '^[A-Za-z]{1}[A-Za-z\\*]{4}[A-Za-z]{1}[A-Za-z\\*]{1}[0-9]{1}[0-9A-Za-z]{1}[0-9\\*]{1}[0-9A-Za-z]{2}$'"}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Convert the file DL_WA to Microsoft Copilot Studio Yaml.  File content:      <grammar version='1.0' xml:lang='es-us' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2001/06/grammar' root='_ROOT_'><rule id='_ROOT_' scope='public'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='#license'/><tag>if (SWI_vars.disallow) { var disallow_arr = SWI_vars.disallow.split('^'); disallowList = SWI_vars.disallow; for (var i=0; i &lt; disallow_arr.length; i++) { if (license.SWI_meaning == disallow_arr[i]) { SWI_disallow=1; break; } } } if(license.SWI_meaning) {SWI_meaning=license.SWI_meaning; dm_root=license.SWI_meaning;}; if(license.dm_command) {SWI_meaning=license.dm_command; dm_command=license.dm_command}; if(license.dm_confirmation_mode) {dm_confirmation_mode=license.dm_confirmation_mode}; if(license.dm_confirm_string) {dm_confirm_string=license.dm_confirm_string}; grammar_version='20180502'; MEANING=SWI_meaning; for (var i=0; i &lt; 4; i++) { if (SWI_meaning.substring(i,i+1) === '*' &amp;&amp; SWI_meaning.substring(i+1,5) !== Array(5-i).join('*')) { SWI_disallow=1; break; } } ps_gramlib_id='untested_nr10_esus_drivers_license_WA'</tag></item></one-of></rule><rule id='license' scope='public'><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag><item repeat='4'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#star'/><tag>V = V ? V + '*' : '*';</tag></item></one-of></item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag><one-of><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#star'/><tag>V = V ? V + '*' : '*';</tag></item></one-of><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag><one-of><item><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item></one-of><one-of><item><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#star'/><tag>V = V ? V + '*' : '*';</tag></item></one-of><item repeat='2'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item></one-of></item><tag>SWI_meaning=V;</tag></rule></grammar>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: CustomRegexEntity\nreason: The provided grammar defines specific combinations of alphanumeric characters and special characters for driver's license numbers, which cannot be accurately represented by built-in entities or synonyms. It requires validating based on a regular expression pattern.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: DL_WA\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: DL_WA\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '^[A-Za-z](?:[A-Za-z*]{4})[A-Za-z](?:[A-Za-z*])[0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9])[0-9*](?:[A-Za-z0-9]{2})$'"}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Convert the file DL_WI(1) to Microsoft Copilot Studio Yaml.  File content:      <grammar version='1.0' xml:lang='en-us' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2001/06/grammar' root='_ROOT_'><rule id='_ROOT_' scope='public'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='#license'/><tag>if (SWI_vars.disallow) { var disallow_arr = SWI_vars.disallow.split('^'); disallowList = SWI_vars.disallow; for (var i=0; i &lt; disallow_arr.length; i++) { if (license.SWI_meaning == disallow_arr[i]) { SWI_disallow=1; break; } } } if(license.SWI_meaning) {SWI_meaning=license.SWI_meaning; dm_root=license.SWI_meaning;}; if(license.dm_command) {SWI_meaning=license.dm_command; dm_command=license.dm_command}; if(license.dm_confirmation_mode) {dm_confirmation_mode=license.dm_confirmation_mode}; if(license.dm_confirm_string) {dm_confirm_string=license.dm_confirm_string}; grammar_version='20180502'; MEANING=SWI_meaning; ps_gramlib_id='untested_nr10_enus_drivers_license_WI';</tag></item></one-of></rule><rule id='license' scope='public'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='soundexLastName.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + S.V : S.V;</tag><item repeat='0-1'><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#dash'/></item><item repeat='4'><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item repeat='0-1'><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#dash'/></item><item repeat='4'><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item repeat='0-1'><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#dash'/></item><item repeat='2'><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item><item repeat='0-1' repeat-prob='0.01'><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag></item></item><item><item repeat='8'><ruleref uri='digit.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + D.V : D.V;</tag></item></item></one-of><tag>SWI_meaning=V;</tag></rule></grammar>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: CustomEntity (RegexEntity)\nreason: The provided GRXML grammar defines a Driver's License number format that includes an optional last name (by soundex, mapped as special alpha characters), digits in specified groupings, and optional special characters (dashes). These complex formats are not matching any basic predefined entity in Copilot Studio. Since the format includes fixed counts of digits, optional alpha characters, and optional dashes, it is best implemented as a regex to accurately reflect the Wisconsin driver's license format.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: WI_DriversLicense\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: WI_DriversLicense\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '^[A-Z][0-9]{4}-?[0-9]{4}-?[0-9]{2}[A-Z]?$|^[0-9]{8}$'\n    comments: |\n      Matches Wisconsin driver's license format:\n      - first format: 1 letter + 4 digits + optional dash + 4 digits + optional dash + 2 digits + optional 1 letter (e.g., \"A1234-5678-12X\")\n      - second format: 8 digits only (e.g., \"12345678\")\n\n      The optional dashes and letters follow exactly the GRXML logic provided."}]}
