nse structure, consisting of last name (soundex), digits, and optional letters. Given the complex, structured format (letters and digits with optional separators), it is best to represent it with a regular expression (RegexEntity) rather than prebuilt or simple lists.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: DL_WI\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: DL_WI\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '[A-Z]{1,}[ -]?\\d{4}[ -]?\\d{4}[ -]?\\d{2}[A-Z]?'"}]}
