{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Convert the file esn to Microsoft Copilot Studio Yaml.  File content:      <grammar version='1.0' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2001/06/grammar' xml:lang='es-us' root='_esn'><rule id='_esn' scope='public'><item repeat='0-1'>@hes@</item><ruleref uri='#ESN'/><tag>SWI_meaning=ESN.V;MEANING = SWI_meaning;id_type = 'esn';grammar_version='20180718';ps_gramlib_id='untested_nr10_esus_esn';</tag></rule><rule id='ESN'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='#ESN_dec'/><tag>V = ESN_dec.V</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='#ESN_hex'/><tag>V = ESN_hex.V</tag></item></one-of></rule><rule id='ESN_dec'><item repeat='11'><ruleref uri='#DIGIT'/><tag>V = V ? V + DIGIT.V : DIGIT.V</tag></item></rule><rule id='ESN_hex'><item repeat='8'><ruleref uri='hexadecimal.grxml#HEX'/><tag>V = V ? V + HEX.V : HEX.V</tag></item></rule><rule id='DIGIT'><one-of><item>cero<tag>V='0'</tag></item><item>uno<tag>V='1'</tag></item><item>dos<tag>V='2'</tag></item><item>tres<tag>V='3'</tag></item><item>cuatro<tag>V='4'</tag></item><item>cinco<tag>V='5'</tag></item><item>seis<tag>V='6'</tag></item><item>siete<tag>V='7'</tag></item><item>ocho<tag>V='8'</tag></item><item>nueve<tag>V='9'</tag></item></one-of></rule></grammar>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: CustomRegexEntity\nreason: The provided GRXML represents an electronic serial number (ESN) in decimal (11 digits) or hexadecimal (8 digits). This kind of structured alphanumeric input is best represented by regex in Copilot Studio.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: esn\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: esn\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: ^(\\d{11}|[A-Fa-f0-9]{8})$\n      validationMessage: \"Ingrese un ESN válido de 11 dígitos numéricos o 8 caracteres hexadecimales.\""}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Convert the file esn_2 to Microsoft Copilot Studio Yaml.  File content:      <grammar version='1.0' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2001/06/grammar' xml:lang='en-US' root='_esn'><rule id='_esn' scope='public'><item repeat='0-1'>@hes@</item><ruleref uri='#ESN'/><tag>SWI_meaning=ESN.V;MEANING = SWI_meaning;id_type = 'esn';grammar_version='20180718';ps_gramlib_id='untested_nr10_enus_esn';</tag></rule><rule id='ESN'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='#ESN_dec'/><tag>V = ESN_dec.V</tag></item><item><ruleref uri='#ESN_hex'/><tag>V = ESN_hex.V</tag></item></one-of></rule><rule id='ESN_dec'><item repeat='11'><ruleref uri='#DIGIT'/><tag>V = V ? V + DIGIT.V : DIGIT.V</tag></item></rule><rule id='ESN_hex'><item repeat='8'><ruleref uri='hexadecimal.grxml#HEX'/><tag>V = V ? V + HEX.V : HEX.V</tag></item></rule><rule id='DIGIT'><one-of><item><ruleref uri='#ZERO'/><tag>V='0'</tag></item><item>one<tag>V='1'</tag></item><item>two<tag>V='2'</tag></item><item>three<tag>V='3'</tag></item><item>four<tag>V='4'</tag></item><item>five<tag>V='5'</tag></item><item>six<tag>V='6'</tag></item><item>seven<tag>V='7'</tag></item><item>eight<tag>V='8'</tag></item><item>nine<tag>V='9'</tag></item></one-of></rule><rule id='ZERO'><one-of><item>zero</item><item>oh</item></one-of></rule></grammar>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: CustomRegexEntity\nreason: The GRXML rules represent a specific numeric format (decimal of 11 digits or hexadecimal of 8 characters). This is best captured as a RegexEntity in Copilot Studio, as it precisely defines numeric patterns.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: esn_2\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: esn_2\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '(^\\d{11}$|^[A-Fa-f0-9]{8}$)'\n      validationMessage: 'Please enter a valid ESN number, either 11 decimal digits or 8 hexadecimal characters.'"}]}
