{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Convert the file soundexLastName_2 to Microsoft Copilot Studio Yaml.  File content:      <grammar version='1.0' xml:lang='en-us' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2001/06/grammar' root='S'><rule id='S' scope='public'><ruleref uri='alpha.grxml'/><tag>V = V ? V + A.V : A.V;</tag><item repeat='0-1'><ruleref uri='special_chars.grxml#dash'/></item><one-of><item><item repeat='3'><ruleref uri='#D6'/><tag>V = V ? V + D6.V : D6.V;</tag></item></item><item><ruleref uri='#natnum_subset'/><tag>V = V + natnum_subset.V;</tag></item></one-of><tag>if( ( (V.substring(1,2) == '0') &amp;&amp; (V.substring(2,4) != '00') ) || ( (V.substring(2,3) == '0') &amp;&amp; (V.substring(3,4) != '0') ) ) { SWI_disallow = 1; }</tag></rule><rule id='D6'><one-of><item>oh<tag>V='0'</tag></item><item>zero<tag>V='0'</tag></item><item>one<tag>V='1'</tag></item><item>two<tag>V='2'</tag></item><item>three<tag>V='3'</tag></item><item>four<tag>V='4'</tag></item><item>five<tag>V='5'</tag></item><item>six<tag>V='6'</tag></item></one-of></rule><rule id='natnum_subset'><one-of><item>one<tag>V='1'</tag></item><item>two<tag>V='2'</tag></item><item>three<tag>V='3'</tag></item><item>four<tag>V='4'</tag></item><item>five<tag>V='5'</tag></item><item>six<tag>V='6'</tag></item></one-of>hundred<tag>V = V + '00';</tag></rule></grammar>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: Custom entity (RegexEntity)\nreason: The grammar is complex, allowing combinations of letters, special characters, and numerical digits (spoken as \"oh\", \"zero\", \"one\", \"hundred\", etc.). It can't be represented simply as a ClosedListEntity. Regular expressions (RegexEntity) are required to handle the specific patterns for letters followed by an optional dash and numerical digit (0-6), or natural numbers (100 to 600).\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: soundexLastName_2\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: soundexLastName_2\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '^[A-Za-z]+-?((([0-6]{3}))|([1-6]00))$'"}]}
