r>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "entity_type: CustomEntity\nreason: The GRXML grammar describes a specific alpha-numeric pattern involving letters, digits, and special characters (\"star\"/\"asterisk\"). This complex pattern cannot be represented correctly by a prebuilt entity or a simple list, therefore, you should convert it to a RegexEntity for capturing structured alphanumeric driver's license inputs.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: DL_MB\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: DL_MB\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '^([A-Za-z*]{5}[A-Za-z]{1}[A-Za-z*]{1}[0-9]{2}[A-Za-z0-9]{3})$'\n      caseSensitive: false\n      regexFlags: ''\n      examples:\n        - ABCDEFA12B3\n        - A*CDEFB34X9\n        - ***D*EZ99YZ\n        - ABC**FG12H3\n        - ABCDEFX88K7"}]}
