learly with the use of a RegexEntity, as no prebuilt entity matches these specific driver's license format requirements.\ncopilot_studio_code: |\n  - kind: CustomEntityComponent\n    displayName: DL_VI\n    state: Active\n    status: Active\n    schemaName: DL_VI\n    entity:\n      kind: RegexEntity\n      regexPattern: '(([A-Za-z][0-9]{9})|([TCtc][0-9]{10,11})|(J[0-9]{10})|([A-Za-z][0-9]{12}))'"}]}
